// 015.7 (#67): `Expose` declares which acts/events an external application may trigger
// and which open/evidenced facts it supplies; internal duties and derived facts stay hidden.
Fact bidder Identified by Alice, Bob.
Open Fact reserve-met Identified by bidder.
Fact internal-ledger Identified by bidder.

Power place-bid Actor bidder
  Holds when True
  Valid when reserve-met(bidder)
  Creates internal-ledger(bidder).

Event end-auction Related to bidder
  Terminates internal-ledger(bidder).

Expose place-bid, end-auction.
Expose Input reserve-met.

Scenario exposed-ok {
  +reserve-met(Alice).
  place-bid(Alice).
  ?internal-ledger(Alice).
}
